    "description": "Lung health is not a priority of the public health agenda in Pakistan pointed out Professor Javaid Khan, Head of Pulmonary and Critical Care Medicine, Department of Medicine, Aga Khan University (AKU) speaking at a seminar organised by the National Alliance for Tobacco Control in collaboration with the Pakistan Chest Society on World COPD (chronic obstructive pulmonary disease) Day.",
